(--- WHATSAPP GROUP CHAT EXPORT: Goa Trip Planning ---) '
(10/05/24, 10:15 AM - Rahul: Hey everyone! Are we still planning the Goa trip for next weekend?) '
(10/05/24, 10:16 AM - Priya: Yes absolutely! We need to book the flight tickets today.) '
(10/05/24, 10:17 AM - Amit: Flights from Ahmedabad to Goa are around Rs 4500 right now.) '
(10/05/24, 10:18 AM - Rahul: That sounds reasonable. Should we stay in North Goa or South Goa?) '
(10/05/24, 10:19 AM - Priya: North Goa near Anjuna beach has great cafes and nightlife.) '
(10/05/24, 10:20 AM - Rahul: Amit please share your ID proof so I can book the villa on Airbnb.) '
(10/05/24, 10:22 AM - Amit: Sent the Aadhar card on your private chat Rahul.) '
(10/05/24, 10:25 AM - Rahul: Thanks Amit. Booking confirmed for 4 nights starting Friday.) '
(10/05/24, 10:26 AM - Priya: Awesome! I will make the list of food spots and restaurants we must visit.) '
(10/05/24, 10:30 AM - Rahul: Don't forget to rent self-drive scooters from the airport.) '
(10/05/24, 10:32 AM - Amit: Got it, looking forward to the beach and sunset!) '
ET

